  "_about": "Every building type. Costs are paid once. Upkeep is coins per minute. Times are in seconds. 'size' is [width, height] in tiles. 'visual' sets how the building looks: 'art' names its drawing (leave it out for a plain box), 'color' is its main color, usually the roof, and 'height' is how tall it stands. 'key' is the keyboard shortcut that picks the building; W A S D, C and the number keys are taken. 'staff' is how many people a producer needs to run at full speed (see 'workforce' in config.json). Keys starting with _ are notes and are ignored by the game.",

